OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 4 JUN
OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GPetroc introduces live music from
OL,6,     Gthe Scottish Chamber Orchestra
OL,7,     Gcello ensemble ahead of the
OL,8,     GScottish Chamber Orchestra's
OL,9,     Gsummer tour.
OL,10,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,11,     GHalf an hour of back-to-back
OL,12,     Gclassical music, including works
OL,13,     Gby Bach, Mozart and Amy Beach.
OL,14,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,15,     GAs part of Wigmore Hall's 125th
OL,16,     GAnniversary Festival, Canadian
OL,17,     Gpianist Angela Hewitt plays
OL,18,     GMozart, Beethoven, Schubert,
OL,19,     GHaydn and Bach.
