OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 4 JUN
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: The Other
OL,5,     FShostakoviches
OL,6,     GChris Addison explores the ill-
OL,7,     Gfated life of the hard-drinking,
OL,8,     Gcigar-smoking wildman of Soviet
OL,9,     Gmusic Alexander Mosolov - whose
OL,10,     Gcareer was interrupted by a spell
OL,11,     Gin the gulag.
OL,12,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,13,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,14,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,15,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,16,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,17,     Geverything in between.
OL,18,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,19,     GSoweto is back with more exciting
OL,20,     Gnew releases and jazz classics,
OL,21,     Gand Huw Marc Bennett has a fourth
OL,22,     Gartist to celebrate on Flowers.
